{
  "id": "universal-pivot",
  "name": "Pivot",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Turn around out of a dash and stand still",
  "why": "A pivot stops a dash on the spot with {char} facing the other way. From the turn {char} can attack, grab, shield or jump as from standing, so {char} can dash away from an opponent and hit back toward them without a dash attack or the landing lag of a wavedash.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 140,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A pivot is a dash turned around with a flick: the stick past 0.8 the other way for one frame. {char} does not dash back: the turn plays out and {char} stands, facing the other way.",
    "expect": "Each dash is judged when {char} stops: whether a turn out of it ended with {char} standing. Dashes back before the pivot do not count against it. After misses, the coach shows the dash and the turns frame by frame.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 4
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          -0.5,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 5,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          -1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 6,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          -0.5,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 7,
        "hold": 1
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: stick to the side. Dash",
      "5": "Frame 5: the stick crosses back, halfway",
      "6": "Frame 6: the stick past 0.8 the other way. Turn",
      "7": "Frame 7: the stick back under 0.8. No dash back",
      "8": "Frame {f}: the turn plays out, {char} standing"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Turn, then dash back or stand",
        "text": [
          "A dash turned around spends one frame in a turn. On the next frame, a stick still past 0.8 the other way starts a dash back. Below 0.8, the turn plays out with {char} standing, facing the other way: a pivot.",
          "Flick the stick the other way from the dash's 5th frame. It has to pass 0.8 within 2 frames of crossing the center, and be back under it on the next frame: held at full for 2 frames, it dashes back."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 4
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  -0.5,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 5,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  -1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  -0.5,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 7,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: dash",
              "4": "Frame 4: the last frame that ignores the stick",
              "5": "Frame 5: the stick crosses back, halfway",
              "6": "Frame 6: past 0.8 the other way. Turn",
              "7": "Frame 7: back under 0.8. No dash back",
              "8": "Frame {f}: turn. {char} stands, facing the other way"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  4
                ],
                "words": "Dash",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  6
                ],
                "words": "Flick the stick the other way",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  7,
                  7
                ],
                "words": "Let it come back now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  8,
                  12
                ],
                "words": "Turn: standing, facing the other way",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "On the stage",
      "stage": "final-destination",
      "player": {
        "x": -20
      },
      "opponent": "none",
      "camera": {
        "follow": "player",
        "distance": 220,
